<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Carton de Colombia started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Carton de Colombia started.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>ING Barings analysts Paulo Vaconcellos and Paula Garcia have started coverage of paper company Carton de Colombia with a rating of buy.</p>
<p>-- In a report, they described Carton as &quot;a world-class paper company.&quot;  They set a June 1998 price target of $1.29, implying a 24 percent rise from current levels.</p>
<p>-- Carton is controlled by Ireland's Jefferson Smurfit Group Plc.</p>
<p>((--Ian Simpson, Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1879))</p>
